id":3868641311,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7mlsgf","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-09T00:14:10Z","updated_at":"2026-02-09T00:22:32Z","body":"I suspect there's a problem with the underlying rendering engine; the `SubViewport` is displaying incorrect content in the preview. \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f13c517-3aea-46e9-93a6-5c00d910fce3\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9/editor/inspector/sub_viewport_preview_editor_plugin.cpp#L42\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/56f3e2611daadb0b1894b46737ee3000e82e33f9/editor/scene/texture/texture_editor_plugin.cpp#L259\n\nThe textures used there are obtained directly, so there is no issue with incorrect path updates.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3868641311/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengin